## 📂 Project Structure

```
agritech-pro/
├── apps/
│   ├── chatbot/       # RAG engine, RAGChatbot class, View logic
│   ├── scanner/       # CNN model inference, Image handling
│   ├── weather/       # Weather API service
│   └── market/        # Price data service
├── config/            # Project settings (URLS, WSGI, ASGI)
├── media/             # Uploaded images (leaf scans)
├── models/            # Serialized AI models (.h5) & Vector DB
├── static/            # CSS, JS, Images, Icons
├── templates/         # HTML Templates
└── manage.py          # Django entry point
```

## 🧠 AI Configuration (LM Studio)

To enable the chatbot:
1. Open **LM Studio**.
2. Load a model (e.g., `Mistral-7B-Instruct`).
3. Go to the "Server" tab.
4. Start the server on **Port 1234**.
5. Enable **CORS** (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing).
6. Ensure the `MISTRAL_AI_BASE_URL` in `.env` matches the server URL.

---

## 🔒 Security & Performance
- **CSRF Protection**: Enabled globally.
- **Input Validation**: Strict type checking on all API endpoints.
- **Offline Capable**: Critical data cached for low-connectivity areas.

